00:21:50.820 --> 00:21:53.980
There are actually people out there who want to cancel Christmas.

00:21:54.470 --> 00:21:55.670
Are you on their side?

00:21:56.150 --> 00:21:56.630
Uh...

00:21:59.570 --> 00:21:59.970
Rowing...

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:06.400
someone off a roof. Is that how you want to remember Christmas? You must have asked Santa

00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:14.250
for something. Do you think you deserve what you've asked for? It's a two-way street. Santa

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:19.370
doesn't just give you stuff because you ask. You have to deserve it. I'm trying to deserve the

00:22:19.370 --> 00:22:25.900
good things I have and the good things I hope I will have in the future. If you want me to fail

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:29.580
then I guess it's too late to save Christmas. It's already gone.

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:31.780
Come on, Martini.

00:22:32.760 --> 00:22:33.240
A drill.

00:22:33.770 --> 00:22:34.130
What?

00:22:35.300 --> 00:22:38.840
I asked Santa for a reversible three-speed cordless electric drill.

00:22:39.470 --> 00:22:41.470
I'm too naughty to deserve such a nice drill.

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:43.280
All right, pull yourself together.

00:22:43.590 --> 00:22:44.650
Let's think about this.

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:45.700
Olive, huh?

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:46.680
That's right.

00:22:47.140 --> 00:22:48.140
I'm sorry, Olive.

00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:50.060
We're really not such a bad bunch.

00:22:50.900 --> 00:22:54.300
When you're this far north with no sunlight,

00:22:56.040 --> 00:22:59.890
sometimes tempers fray, life's hard enough.

00:23:00.250 --> 00:23:05.500
And now, Santa's flight, it's been an awful day.

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:13.000
Employment in these latitudes depends on old Saint Nick.

00:23:16.060 --> 00:23:18.060
So forgive us if we all have attitudes.

00:23:19.280 --> 00:23:20.460
We're up a frozen crack.

00:23:22.660 --> 00:23:23.760
We're not so bad.

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:24.600
We're not so bad.

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:26.210
We're really sweet and funny.

00:23:26.430 --> 00:23:27.970
We're not so bad.

00:23:28.190 --> 00:23:29.370
Except for that funny.

00:23:30.920 --> 00:23:33.580
We're not so bad, we're not so bad, we're not so bad

00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:39.100
When you walked in, may I be frank

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:41.410
Of course we were suspicious

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:45.440
It seemed you were playing a nasty prank

00:23:45.440 --> 00:23:47.820
That's why we got malicious

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:51.830
But we're not so bad, we're not so fearful

00:23:51.830 --> 00:23:54.990
Once you get to know us, we're downright triple

00:23:55.750 --> 00:23:58.990
We're not so bad, we're not so bad, we're not so bad

00:24:01.150 --> 00:24:03.010
We know you if you ever come again

00:24:03.010 --> 00:24:04.970
We promise not to throw you

00:24:04.970 --> 00:24:07.340
We're not so bad

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:08.560
We're not so bad

00:24:09.620 --> 00:24:14.670
Go on you guys, he can take you up on his half track

00:24:14.920 --> 00:24:16.860
Olive, Round John Virgin

00:24:16.860 --> 00:24:18.930
Like in the Silent Night song

00:24:18.930 --> 00:24:20.610
I don't know what you're talking about

00:24:20.660 --> 00:24:23.720
Anyway, Round John can take you as far as the North Pole gates

00:24:23.720 --> 00:24:25.760
After that, you're on your own

00:24:25.760 --> 00:24:27.570
We'll figure out something

00:24:27.570 --> 00:24:29.390
I'm Blitzen's cousin Schnitzel

00:24:30.030 --> 00:24:30.990
Flightless, unfortunately.

00:24:31.340 --> 00:24:31.940
It happens.

00:24:32.610 --> 00:24:33.430
We're ready to go.

00:24:33.870 --> 00:24:34.850
Thanks, schnitzel.

00:24:35.980 --> 00:24:37.420
The puffin's going too.

00:24:37.720 --> 00:24:39.400
That's penguin to you, pal.

00:24:40.910 --> 00:24:42.690
Good luck, and Merry Christmas.

00:24:43.180 --> 00:24:45.220
Do I look like a puffin?

00:25:00.860 --> 00:25:04.380
Tim, wait. Tim.

00:25:04.640 --> 00:25:07.840
Hey, hey, come on. Olive, time to wake up.

00:25:16.930 --> 00:25:20.470
Time to do your thing. Good luck, Olive.

00:25:20.980 --> 00:25:23.180
And I'm sorry I was such a jerk earlier.

00:25:23.440 --> 00:25:24.620
It's okay, Round John.

00:25:25.070 --> 00:25:28.110
You're not the only one who's let their emotions get the better of them today.

00:25:28.560 --> 00:25:29.560
Hey, thanks for the ride.

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:32.380
Here, high-quality office supplies for you.

00:25:33.220 --> 00:25:35.400
Gee, city zoo envelopes.

00:25:35.900 --> 00:25:36.480
Thanks.

00:25:36.960 --> 00:25:37.980
Merry Christmas.

00:25:40.930 --> 00:25:41.350
Goodbye.

00:25:42.450 --> 00:25:42.930
Good luck.

00:25:43.230 --> 00:25:49.430
