00:26:19.430 --> 00:26:23.050
But Santa said on the radio that he was counting on Olive, the other reindeer.

00:26:23.550 --> 00:26:24.270
That's me.

00:26:24.450 --> 00:26:25.850
I'm filling in for Blitzen.

00:26:26.050 --> 00:26:26.970
