00:26:27.150 --> 00:26:28.250
But I have to...

00:26:28.250 --> 00:26:28.470
No.

00:26:28.920 --> 00:26:29.980
Isn't there someone who I could...

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:44.050
Tom. No. Don't you even care? Let me think. No. No. Now move along or I'll have you arrested. And I'm warning you, the fence is protected by alarms. So just go back where you came from. But I...

00:26:44.400 --> 00:26:57.990
Time to think of plan B. Hmm. While you're thinking, maybe I'll just go use that payphone. Payphone? Yes!

00:27:02.000 --> 00:27:03.220
Oh, oh, oh.

00:27:04.800 --> 00:27:05.140
Huh?

00:27:07.180 --> 00:27:07.460
Oh.

00:27:08.420 --> 00:27:08.860
Ah.

00:27:11.240 --> 00:27:11.680
Huh?

00:27:13.530 --> 00:27:16.290
This is the rice repair center.

00:27:16.570 --> 00:27:18.590
Oh, we'll send a man over right away, sir.

00:27:18.690 --> 00:27:20.170
It'll be a penguin, actually.

00:27:20.540 --> 00:27:22.060
Oh, he'll have it working in no time.

00:27:22.720 --> 00:27:23.520
All right, then.

00:27:23.780 --> 00:27:24.020
Goodbye.

00:27:26.560 --> 00:27:29.980
You know, this could be an exfoliated carburetor or.

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:31.940
