00:27:44.840 --> 00:27:45.120
What?

00:27:45.360 --> 00:27:49.360
Well, otherwise, the electromagnetic wave will interfere with the signals from the satellite.

00:27:50.040 --> 00:27:50.540
All right.

00:27:51.500 --> 00:27:59.510
It just needs the complementary engraving, E-L-F, right?

00:28:00.670 --> 00:28:02.630
I'll tell you what, I'll have it back for you on Monday.

00:28:03.030 --> 00:28:04.450
And I'm sorry for the inconvenience.

00:28:05.180 --> 00:28:05.960
Merry Christmas!

00:28:19.140 --> 00:28:22.600
Special delivery! More children's letters to Santa!

00:28:30.540 --> 00:28:33.320
Let's do the press conference, boss, and hope for better luck next year.

00:28:33.500 --> 00:28:36.080
There must be some way you could go.

00:28:36.480 --> 00:28:38.760
Can't we fly with seven reindeer?

00:28:39.120 --> 00:28:40.480
I doubt we could handle it, Chief.

00:28:41.140 --> 00:28:42.480
Maybe we shouldn't even try.

00:28:43.310 --> 00:28:47.230
So many of the kids' letters this year haven't been very nice.

00:28:48.460 --> 00:28:50.040
Dear Santa, I hate you.

00:28:50.480 --> 00:28:52.550
Don't come to my house, Johnny.

00:28:52.870 --> 00:28:54.610
Boss, that's awful news.

00:28:55.540 --> 00:28:59.610
Dear Santa, lose some weight and get a real job.

00:29:00.600 --> 00:29:04.130
Yeah, maybe it's time to retire anyway.

00:29:04.710 --> 00:29:07.020
No, those letters are fake.

00:29:08.260 --> 00:29:10.980
