00:29:51.480 --> 00:29:55.000
Everyone loves you Santa and all over the world

00:29:55.000 --> 00:29:59.740
Everyone is hoping you'll fly tonight and make their dreams come true. I know I don't look like much

00:30:00.220 --> 00:30:03.980
But give me a try for all those good folks who deserve what they've asked for.

00:30:04.480 --> 00:30:06.700
I guess they'll understand if you can't make it.

00:30:07.170 --> 00:30:09.930
But Round John Virgin sure would like that electric drill.

00:30:10.130 --> 00:30:13.850
And my master, Tim, well, maybe he does want a better dog.

00:30:13.850 --> 00:30:16.350
But mostly, I think he just wants Christmas.

00:30:17.170 --> 00:30:19.810
I don't think he'll find a better dog, Olive.

00:30:20.130 --> 00:30:21.670
Even if you are a reindeer.

00:30:22.440 --> 00:30:23.340
Thanks for coming.

00:30:24.260 --> 00:30:27.050
Oh, people, we're flying.

00:30:28.070 --> 00:30:29.820
Tell the media.

00:30:30.060 --> 00:30:31.380
Load up the sleigh.

00:30:31.500 --> 00:30:33.540
Come and help Olive here get hitched up.

00:30:34.850 --> 00:30:36.770
I've just learned that you'd better not pout,

00:30:36.930 --> 00:30:38.950
you'd better not cry, you'd better not shout.

00:30:39.110 --> 00:30:40.110
I'm telling you why.

00:30:40.270 --> 00:30:43.450
A mysterious other reindeer has arrived to take Blitzen's place.

00:30:43.690 --> 00:30:45.550
As of now, the flight is on again.

00:30:45.840 --> 00:30:47.760
I'll be darned she really did it.

00:30:47.860 --> 00:30:49.540
Who's she? What's going on?

00:30:49.660 --> 00:30:52.320
Well, see, earlier today...

00:31:10.550 --> 00:31:13.010
Oh, she had a clear sense of mission.

00:31:13.660 --> 00:31:14.980
Cares deeply about Christmas.

00:31:15.240 --> 00:31:17.440
Close, close friend of mine for years.

00:31:17.660 --> 00:31:20.540
Not, not, not housebroken, not to my knowledge.

00:31:20.700 --> 00:31:22.180
She is housebroken.

00:31:23.460 --> 00:31:25.830
There you go.

00:31:26.180 --> 00:31:27.940
By the way, where's Rudolph?

00:31:28.460 --> 00:31:29.980
There's no Rudolph, it's just one.

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:37.620
of those urban legends sleigh's loaded everyone ready ready all of the other reindeer huh well

00:31:37.620 --> 00:31:44.820
why not it's a season of miracles good luck kid oh thanks comet santa one niner niner niner

